    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>IMPORTANT: A live Twitch stream is required to play Duck Race.</strong></h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152420/extras/4afa8e45f3c897b11f3c4afe368ca8af.avif?t=1719485674\" /></div><br>Duck Race is the latest in Twitch viewer interaction!<br>Invite your viewers to enter the race as an adorable rubber duck, and kit them out with a variety of skins and accessories. Let them loose across a number of rivers and environments, and cheer as they race to be the first over the waterfall!<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Full Twitch.tv chat integration<br></li><li> !quack to join the race<br></li><li> Customise with a number of skins to choose from<br></li><li> Add additional flare with over 25 hats and accessories<br></li><li> Custom Duck names - escape the restrictions of <i>username326</i></li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152420/extras/c9673d5812f7d79821dbfebe711e5c2e.poster.avif?t=1719485674\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152420/extras/c9673d5812f7d79821dbfebe711e5c2e.webm?t=1719485674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152420/extras/c9673d5812f7d79821dbfebe711e5c2e.mp4?t=1719485674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Early Response</strong><br><i>&quot;\u201cDuck Race is super-cute. My viewers love their tiny rubber ducks in funny hats, and I love how fun they look when they go over a waterfall.\u201d - <strong>John Robertson  + The Dark Room) </strong></i><br><br><i>&quot;Duckrace is one of the best and easiest community, chill games out there. <br>Rubber duck racing? <br>HECK YEAH&quot; - <strong>MEOwTiNgZ</strong></i><br><br><i>&quot;Let's just say Duck Race moved me... TO A BIGGER HOUSE!<br>(Oops, I said the quiet part loud and the loud part quiet.)<br>No but seriously, Duck Race is super fun and really easy to explain to new viewers, instant conversational starter.&quot; - <strong>THRILLHOO</strong></i><br><br><br><strong>Controls</strong><br>Mostly intuitive controls, but with a little nuance:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Click ducks on the home screen to set player skin options<br></li><li> Click left mouse to take/release control of the camera<br></li><li> Mouse to turn camera<br></li><li> WASD to move camera - Shift speeds you up<br></li><li> Numbers 1-9 for set camera locations<br></li><li> Space to move UP, Left Ctrl to move DOWN<br></li><li> M to mute music<br></li><li> +/- to increase/decrease camera movement speed<br></li><li> Q to show/hide names</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>IMPORTANT: A live Twitch stream is required to play Duck Race.</strong></h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152420/extras/4afa8e45f3c897b11f3c4afe368ca8af.avif?t=1719485674\" /></div><br>Duck Race is the latest in Twitch viewer interaction!<br>Invite your viewers to enter the race as an adorable rubber duck, and kit them out with a variety of skins and accessories. Let them loose across a number of rivers and environments, and cheer as they race to be the first over the waterfall!<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Full Twitch.tv chat integration<br></li><li> !quack to join the race<br></li><li> Customise with a number of skins to choose from<br></li><li> Add additional flare with over 25 hats and accessories<br></li><li> Custom Duck names - escape the restrictions of <i>username326</i></li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152420/extras/c9673d5812f7d79821dbfebe711e5c2e.poster.avif?t=1719485674\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152420/extras/c9673d5812f7d79821dbfebe711e5c2e.webm?t=1719485674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152420/extras/c9673d5812f7d79821dbfebe711e5c2e.mp4?t=1719485674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Early Response</strong><br><i>&quot;\u201cDuck Race is super-cute. My viewers love their tiny rubber ducks in funny hats, and I love how fun they look when they go over a waterfall.\u201d - <strong>John Robertson  + The Dark Room) </strong></i><br><br><i>&quot;Duckrace is one of the best and easiest community, chill games out there. <br>Rubber duck racing? <br>HECK YEAH&quot; - <strong>MEOwTiNgZ</strong></i><br><br><i>&quot;Let's just say Duck Race moved me... TO A BIGGER HOUSE!<br>(Oops, I said the quiet part loud and the loud part quiet.)<br>No but seriously, Duck Race is super fun and really easy to explain to new viewers, instant conversational starter.&quot; - <strong>THRILLHOO</strong></i><br><br><br><strong>Controls</strong><br>Mostly intuitive controls, but with a little nuance:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Click ducks on the home screen to set player skin options<br></li><li> Click left mouse to take/release control of the camera<br></li><li> Mouse to turn camera<br></li><li> WASD to move camera - Shift speeds you up<br></li><li> Numbers 1-9 for set camera locations<br></li><li> Space to move UP, Left Ctrl to move DOWN<br></li><li> M to mute music<br></li><li> +/- to increase/decrease camera movement speed<br></li><li> Q to show/hide names</li></ul>",
